Sets the intensity minutes goal from 2026-10-12. The type goes into the path with dashes and into the body in Garmin's upper case form.
-- args --
goals
set
intensity-minutes
150
--date
2026-10-12
-- route PUT /goal-service/goal/user/effective/intensity-minutes/2026-10-12 --
{"goalType":"INTENSITY_MINUTES","goalValue":150}
